<p>You fire a shot into your target's eyes, blinding it for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns and doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">122%, 131%, 138%, 144%, 150%</acronym> damage.</p><p>The blind chance increases with your Accuracy.</p>